    "summary": "The three code tasks with a scope of their own (modules, entry points, module tree) resolve it through resolveTaskScope, read the registered repo that contains it and keep only the entities of the area the scope names (graphRepoOf, inAreaOf in shared/task-scope.ts). The adherence check takes its repo from the same function with the family of the template that runs. The code family's resolveRepoPath and its test hook are removed; docs.discovery.inventory imported that function, so it moved to the scope function in this task. Ten mutations were each caught by the new tests; the analyze suite compared by test name with the Story's baseline loses only the tests of the removed functions.",
